{"title": "Produce Flame", "pageid": 1670, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Produce_Flame", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Cantrips", "Conjuration spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Actions", "Sources of Fire damage", "Bugs", "Light Emitting"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Produce_Flame.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Produce_Flame.webp/300px-Produce_Flame.webp, /w/images/3/39/Produce_Flame.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Produce_Flame.webp/300px-Produce_Flame.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Produce_Flame.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Produce Flame </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">cantrip (Conjuration)</a>. It creates a blue flame in the caster's palm which emanates light and can be <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">thrown</a> at enemies.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>A flame in your hand sheds a light in a 9 m (30 ft) radius and deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage when thrown. \n</p>\nThrowing the flame immediately after you conjure it does not cost an <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>. Extinguishing or throwing it on subsequent turns costs an action. The throw has a range of 9 m (30 ft).<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 1~8</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/D8_Fire.png/26px-D8_Fire.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/D8_Fire.png/40px-D8_Fire.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/D8_Fire.png/53px-D8_Fire.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/D8_Fire.png/26px-D8_Fire.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/D8_Fire.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d8</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<ul><li>At <a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">character level</a> 5, the damage of the hurled flame increases to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a>.</li>\n<li>At character level 10, the damage of the hurled flame increases to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">3d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_ProduceFlame</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_ProduceFlame\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_ProduceFlame\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame:_Hurl\" title=\"Produce Flame: Hurl\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/40px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/60px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/80px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Produce Flame: Hurl\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/40px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame:_Hurl\" title=\"Produce Flame: Hurl\">Produce Flame: Hurl</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame:_Dismiss\" title=\"Produce Flame: Dismiss\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Produce_Flame_Dismiss_Icon.webp/40px-Produce_Flame_Dismiss_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Produce_Flame_Dismiss_Icon.webp/60px-Produce_Flame_Dismiss_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Produce_Flame_Dismiss_Icon.webp/80px-Produce_Flame_Dismiss_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Produce Flame: Dismiss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Produce_Flame_Dismiss_Icon.webp/40px-Produce_Flame_Dismiss_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Produce_Flame_Dismiss_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame:_Dismiss\" title=\"Produce Flame: Dismiss\">Produce Flame: Dismiss</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Produce_Flame\"> Condition: Produce Flame </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame_(Condition)\" title=\"Produce Flame (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Produce_Flame_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Produce_Flame_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Produce_Flame_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Produce_Flame_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Produce_Flame_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Produce_Flame_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Produce Flame\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Produce_Flame_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Produce_Flame_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Produce_Flame_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame_(Condition)\" title=\"Produce Flame (Condition)\">Produce Flame</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>A flickering flame sheds light in a 9 m (30 ft) radius around the creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a></li></ul>Races: <ul><li> Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Asmodeus_Tiefling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Asmodeus Tiefling\">Asmodeus Tiefling</a> </li></ul>\n<p>(<i>Character level</i> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)\n</p>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\">Magic Initiate: Cleric</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\">Magic Initiate: Druid</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Devotion_Robe\" title=\"Moon Devotion Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Devotion_Robe\" title=\"Moon Devotion Robe\">Moon Devotion Robe</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>There are no scrolls available for <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Objects such as torches, campfires, and braziers ignite when taking fire damage; this spell provides an easy way to ignite them from a distance.</li>\n<li>On console, if you did not enter combat with the flame in hand, you can use the Hurl action by casting the spell from the radial menu, then selecting the spell a second time, bringing up a submenu, and selecting Hurl. If you were holding a flame at the start of combat, you may have to create a radial menu option to Hurl the flame. Highlight the radial space you would like to use, then consult the bottom right for the contextual button to \"Set Slot\".</li>\n<li>Produce Flame has two incantations: <i>\"Fiat Lux\"</i>, Latin for \"let there be light\", and <i>\"Sol Invictus\"</i>, Latin for \"unconquered sun\".</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The damage on the tooltip for Produce Flame is not marked correctly for the increases at level 5 and 10. The tooltip for the throwing action, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame:_Hurl\" title=\"Produce Flame: Hurl\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/20px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/30px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/40px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Produce Flame: Hurl\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/20px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame:_Hurl\" title=\"Produce Flame: Hurl\">Produce Flame: Hurl</a>, is marked correctly, and the damage scales correctly.</li>\n<li>The version of this Cantrip granted to <a href=\"/wiki/Asmodeus_tiefling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Asmodeus tiefling\">Asmodeus tieflings</a> uses the character's Wisdom modifier to hurl the flame, rather than Charisma as stated in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame:_Hurl\" title=\"Produce Flame: Hurl\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/20px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/30px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/40px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Produce Flame: Hurl\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp/20px-Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Produce_Flame_Hurl_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame:_Hurl\" title=\"Produce Flame: Hurl\">Produce Flame: Hurl</a> tooltip.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Produce_flame\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Produce flame\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Produce_flame\">Produce flame</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/